{"id":"580b00b43dcd196a","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-settheoretic-realization.md","title":"Set-Theoretic Realizations","display":"df-settheoretic-realization — Set-Theoretic Realizations","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-settheoretic-realization","aliases":["89-df-settheoretic-realization"],"display":"df-settheoretic-realization — Set-Theoretic Realizations","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-formula]]","[[89-df-settheoretic-language]]","[[89-df-settheoretic-models]]","[[89-df-formula-graph-expansion]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-settheoretic-realization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-settheoretic-realization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-settheoretic-realization — Set-Theoretic Realizations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" href=\"?note=56c1b5b75a32ca1d\" title=\"89-df-modal-formula\">89-df-modal-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"22c2c4cecc692616\" href=\"?note=22c2c4cecc692616\" title=\"89-df-settheoretic-language\">89-df-settheoretic-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"178d313a2e1d8881\" href=\"?note=178d313a2e1d8881\" title=\"89-df-settheoretic-models\">89-df-settheoretic-models</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"980052349c9e74e5\" href=\"?note=980052349c9e74e5\" title=\"89-df-formula-graph-expansion\">89-df-formula-graph-expansion</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZF},\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in,\\mathsf{Num}_n,\\bot_\\in\">\\(\\mathrm{ZF},\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in,\\mathsf{Num}_n,\\bot_\\in\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"22c2c4cecc692616\" href=\"?note=22c2c4cecc692616\" title=\"89-df-settheoretic-language\">89-df-settheoretic-language</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Sat},\\mathsf{TM}_{\\mathrm{ZF}},\\mathsf{Univ}\">\\(\\mathsf{Sat},\\mathsf{TM}_{\\mathrm{ZF}},\\mathsf{Univ}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"178d313a2e1d8881\" href=\"?note=178d313a2e1d8881\" title=\"89-df-settheoretic-models\">89-df-settheoretic-models</a> 的明确公式。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in\">\\(r:\\mathrm{Prop}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>。翻译值均为纯 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\in\">\\(\\in\\)</span> 语言闭句，所有辅助变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,c\">\\(M,c\\)</span> 先改名避免捕获。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> 在本条表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g_\\in\">\\(g_\\in\\)</span>；下式用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Num}_n\">\\(\\mathsf{Num}_n\\)</span> 实例化数码，不在纯集合论语言中引入数词项或算术函数符号。传递模型解释与不可达宇宙解释保留两套接口。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>每个盒子步骤的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle M,c\\rangle\">\\(\\langle M,c\\rangle\\)</span> 固定取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fresh}(\\mathsf{AV}(\\tau_r^\\bullet(A)),2)\">\\(\\mathsf{Fresh}(\\mathsf{AV}(\\tau_r^\\bullet(A)),2)\\)</span>；模板内的绑定变量由已给的同时替换规则避免捕获。下面盒子步骤的整个右端取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{SetExp}\">\\(\\mathsf{SetExp}\\)</span>，不是把 Sat、TM 或 Univ 留作纯语言的新增谓词。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}settheoretic\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r,\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in,\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r(p)&amp;\\coloneqq r(p),\\quad\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r(p)\\coloneqq r(p),\\quad\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r(\\bot)=\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\bot_\\in,\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r(A),\\quad\n\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r(\\neg A)\\coloneqq\\neg\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r(A),\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r(A)\\land\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r(B),\\quad\n\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r(A\\land B)\\coloneqq\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r(A)\\land\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r(B),\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r(\\Box A)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{SetExp}\\left(\\forall M\\left(\\mathsf{TM}_{\\mathrm{ZF}}(M)\\to\n\\exists c\\bigl(\\mathsf{Num}_{g_\\in(\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r(A))}(c)\\land\\mathsf{Sat}(M,c)\\bigr)\\right)\\right),\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r(\\Box A)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{SetExp}\\left(\\forall M\\left(\\mathsf{Univ}(M)\\to\n\\exists c\\bigl(\\mathsf{Num}_{g_\\in(\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r(A))}(c)\\land\\mathsf{Sat}(M,c)\\bigr)\\right)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}settheoretic\\text{-}realization}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r,\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r&amp;:\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\to\\mathrm{Sent}_\\in,\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r(p)&amp;\\coloneqq r(p),\\quad\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r(p)\\coloneqq r(p),\\quad\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r(\\bot)=\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r(\\bot)\\coloneqq\\bot_\\in,\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r(\\neg A)&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r(A),\\quad\n\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r(\\neg A)\\coloneqq\\neg\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r(A),\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r(A\\land B)&amp;\\coloneqq\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r(A)\\land\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r(B),\\quad\n\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r(A\\land B)\\coloneqq\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r(A)\\land\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r(B),\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r(\\Box A)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{SetExp}\\left(\\forall M\\left(\\mathsf{TM}_{\\mathrm{ZF}}(M)\\to\n\\exists c\\bigl(\\mathsf{Num}_{g_\\in(\\tau^{\\mathrm{tm}}_r(A))}(c)\\land\\mathsf{Sat}(M,c)\\bigr)\\right)\\right),\\\\\n\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r(\\Box A)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{SetExp}\\left(\\forall M\\left(\\mathsf{Univ}(M)\\to\n\\exists c\\bigl(\\mathsf{Num}_{g_\\in(\\tau^{\\mathrm u}_r(A))}(c)\\land\\mathsf{Sat}(M,c)\\bigr)\\right)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\langle M_A^\\bullet,c_A^\\bullet\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{Fresh}(\\mathsf{AV}(\\tau_r^\\bullet(A)),2)\n\\quad(\\bullet\\in\\{\\mathrm{tm},\\mathrm u\\}),\\\\\n\\mathcal D&amp;=\\mathcal B_{\\rm lang}^{+}\\cup\\mathcal B_{\\rm syn}\\cup\\mathcal B_{\\rm mod}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\langle M_A^\\bullet,c_A^\\bullet\\rangle&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\mathsf{Fresh}(\\mathsf{AV}(\\tau_r^\\bullet(A)),2)\n\\quad(\\bullet\\in\\{\\mathrm{tm},\\mathrm u\\}),\\\\\n\\mathcal D&amp;=\\mathcal B_{\\rm lang}^{+}\\cup\\mathcal B_{\\rm syn}\\cup\\mathcal B_{\\rm mod}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补齐所有原始模态构造子的递归条款，并用纯集合论语言中的 Num_n 公式消去原先仅在 Remark 解释的横线数码记法。Sat 仅针对集合大小的结构；不可达基数假设及选择公理的使用位置由相应完全性定理分别列出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"56c1b5b75a32ca1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"8